---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Sobre Mí — May Garcia"
  description="Conoce a May Garcia, artista colombiana especializada en arte contemporáneo e ilustraciones únicas."
>
  <!-- Page Header -->
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Sobre Mí</h1>
      <p>Artista, creadora, colombiana</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container about-layout">
      <!-- Image -->
      <div class="about-image">
        <div class="image-frame">
          <div class="image-placeholder">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 400 500" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <rect width="400" height="500" rx="24" fill="#fff0f6"/>
              <circle cx="200" cy="170" r="80" fill="#ff4691" opacity="0.15"/>
              <circle cx="200" cy="160" r="55" fill="#ff4691" opacity="0.25"/>
              <ellipse cx="200" cy="360" rx="110" ry="80" fill="#ff4691" opacity="0.1"/>
              <circle cx="200" cy="155" r="40" fill="#ff4691" opacity="0.4"/>
            </svg>
            <p class="placeholder-text">Tu foto aquí</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-badge">
          <span>🎨</span>
          <div>
            <strong>May Garcia</strong>
            <small>Artista Visual</small>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Content -->
      <div class="about-content">
        <span class="eyebrow">Mi historia</span>
        <h2>Creando arte que<br />transforma espacios</h2>

        <p>Soy May Garcia, artista colombiana apasionada por crear obras que conectan emociones con espacios. Cada pieza que creo lleva una historia personal, un momento capturado en color y forma.</p>

        <p>Mi trabajo combina técnicas contemporáneas con influencias de la cultura colombiana, creando un estilo único y reconocible. Trabajo principalmente con acrílico, acuarela y técnicas mixtas.</p>

        <div class="about-values">
          <div class="value">
            <span class="value-icon">🌺</span>
            <div>
              <h4>Autenticidad</h4>
              <p>Cada obra es 100% original, creada a mano con materiales premium.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="value">
            <span class="value-icon">💡</span>
            <div>
              <h4>Inspiración</h4>
              <p>Me inspiro en la naturaleza, las emociones y la cultura latinoamericana.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="value">
            <span class="value-icon">🤝</span>
            <div>
              <h4>Conexión</h4>
              <p>Creo arte para conectar personas con emociones y espacios especiales.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-actions">
          <a href="/productos" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Ver mi obra</a>
          <a href="/contacto" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">Contactarme</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Stats -->
  <section class="stats-section">
    <div class="container stats-grid">
      {[
        { number: '5+', label: 'Años creando arte' },
        { number: '200+', label: 'Piezas únicas' },
        { number: '500+', label: 'Clientes felices' },
        { number: '15+', label: 'Exposiciones' },
      ].map(s => (
        <div class="stat-item">
          <span class="stat-num">{s.number}</span>
          <span class="stat-lbl">{s.label}</span>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--pink-bg) 0%, #fff 100%);
    padding: 3rem 0;
    text-align: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .page-header h1 { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .page-header p { color: var(--text-light); }

  /* About Layout */
  .about-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  /* Image */
  .about-image { position: relative; }

  .image-frame {
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 24px 64px rgba(255, 70, 145, 0.18);
  }

  .image-placeholder {
    aspect-ratio: 4/5;
    background: var(--pink-bg);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  .image-placeholder svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; }

  .placeholder-text {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--pink);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .about-badge {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -1.5rem;
    right: -1rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 0.875rem 1.25rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  .about-badge div { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .about-badge strong { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text); }
  .about-badge small { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted); }

  /* Content */
  .about-content .eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--pink);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: 0.875rem;
  }

  .about-content h2 { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }

  .about-content > p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--text-light);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  /* Values */
  .about-values {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin: 2rem 0;
    padding: 2rem;
    background: var(--bg-cream);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  }

  .value {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .value-icon { font-size: 1.5rem; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 0.125rem; }
  .value h4 { font-size: 0.9375rem; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
  .value p { font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--text-light); }

  /* Actions */
  .about-actions { display: flex; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 0.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }

  /* Stats */
  .stats-section {
    background: var(--pink);
    padding: 3.5rem 0;
  }

  .stats-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .stat-item { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.375rem; }
  .stat-num { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 2.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; }
  .stat-lbl { font-size: 0.875rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8); }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3rem; }
    .about-image { max-width: 400px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  }

  @media (max-width: 500px) {
    .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 1.5rem; }
    .about-badge { display: none; }
  }
</style>
